    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "C76E71C6C3591663",
      "text": "Vous souhaitez vous mesurer à notre\\nChampionne, Laïm, l’Esprit Rappeur ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "C76E72C6C3591816",
      "text": "Très bien. Laissez-moi vous conduire jusqu’au\\nterrain de combat.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "C76E73C6C35919C9",
      "text": "Très bien.\\nRevenez me voir quand vous serez prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_receptionist_nobattle",
      "hash64": "D0A496BAB24C009D",
      "text": "Pour vous mesurer à Laïm, vous devez avoir\\nau moins deux Pokémon sur vous !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_00",
      "hash64": "F4F1D404F7C6E265",
      "text": "Yo ! Yo ! ♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "CDB670A9B4004749",
      "text": "Vous entendez des voix qui échangent en rythme\\nen provenance du terrain de combat !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_01",
      "hash64": "F4F1D304F7C6E0B2",
      "text": "Aujourd’hui, c’est mon jour, j’te rosse ! ♪\\nMa grande, j’te bats, t’es tombée sur un os ! ♪",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_02",
      "hash64": "F4F1D204F7C6DEFF",
      "text": "Championne, écoute ce rap de colosse ! ♪\\nSur scène, comme au boulot, c’est moi l’boss ! ♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_02",
      "hash64": "CDB66DA9B4004230",
      "text": "Poum, tchak !\\nPoum, poum, tchak !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "1436B0F9B1C26717",
      "text": "Chez toi, t’as beau être le patron, ♪\\ntes rimes sont aussi rincées qu’un Écayon. ♪\\r\\nHors d’ma vue ! Une phrase, t’étais déjà battu. ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "1436B1F9B1C268CA",
      "text": "Moi, je suis Laïm, toi, t’es une victime. ♪\\nTu m’crois pas ? Attends la suite. ♪\\r\\nJ’explose comme d’la dynamite ! ♪[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "1436B2F9B1C26A7D",
      "text": "T’es qu’un poseur, tu t’prends pour un cador. ♪\\nTu fais pas l’poids, remballe tes rimes, junior. ♪\\r\\nYo ![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_system_03",
      "hash64": "CDB66EA9B40043E3",
      "text": "Poum, tchak !\\nPoum, poum, tchak !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_ghost_040_man_03",
      "hash64": "F4F1D104F7C6DD4C",
      "text": "...\\n...\\c\\nJ’ai flanché, pas d’chance,\\nmais j’aurai ma r’vanche !\\r\\nJ’reviens demain, 15 heures,\\r\\npour une aut’ manche !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
